%% DF-02: 安全扫描流程
%% 流程图: security-scan-flow.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 触发安全扫描]) --> CallScanAPI[调用 scan_skill_security API]
    CallScanAPI --> ReadSkillFile[后端: 读取 Skill 文件]
    ReadSkillFile --> CalcChecksum[后端: 计算 SHA-256 校验和]
    CalcChecksum --> CheckCache{检查缓存<br/>security_scan_cache 表}

    CheckCache -->|缓存命中| ReturnCache[返回缓存结果]
    CheckCache -->|缓存未命中| LoadRules[加载安全规则]

    ReturnCache --> ShowReport[显示安全报告]
    ShowReport --> End([结束])

    LoadRules --> InitRules[初始化规则列表<br/>CommandInjectionRule, SensitiveInfoRule, ...]
    InitRules --> FilterByMode[根据扫描模式筛选规则<br/>strict/standard/relaxed]
    FilterByMode --> LoopRules[遍历规则]

    LoopRules --> CheckEnabled{规则启用?}
    CheckEnabled -->|否| NextRule[下一个规则]
    CheckEnabled -->|是| ExecuteScan[执行规则扫描<br/>scan: content]

    ExecuteScan --> FindFindings[查找风险发现]
    FindFindings --> AddFindings[添加到 findings 列表]
    AddFindings --> NextRule

    NextRule --> LoopRules
    LoopRules -->|完成| CheckWhitelist[检查白名单<br/>whitelist_rules 表]

    CheckWhitelist --> FilterFindings[过滤白名单规则]
    FilterFindings --> CalcPenalty[计算总惩罚分<br/>Σ(finding.severity_penalty)]
    CalcPenalty --> CalcScore[计算安全评分<br/>100 - total_penalty]
    CalcScore --> DetermineLevel{确定安全等级}
    DetermineLevel -->|>=90| SetSafe[设置: safe]
    DetermineLevel -->|70-89| SetRisk[设置: risk]
    DetermineLevel -->|<70| SetBlocked[设置: blocked]

    SetSafe --> GenReport[生成安全报告<br/>SecurityReport]
    SetRisk --> GenReport
    SetBlocked --> GenReport

    GenReport --> SaveReportDB[保存到数据库<br/>security_reports 表]
    SaveReportDB --> SaveCacheDB[保存到缓存<br/>security_scan_cache 表]
    SaveCacheDB --> ReturnReport[返回报告]

    ReturnReport --> FrontendReceive[前端: 接收报告]
    FrontendReceive --> UpdateState[更新状态<br/>React setState]
    UpdateState --> RenderUI[渲染 UI]
    RenderUI --> ShowLevel[显示安全等级<br/>🟢/🟡/🔴]
    ShowLevel --> ShowScore[显示评分<br/>90分]
    ShowScore --> ShowFindingsList[列出发现的问题]
    ShowFindingsList --> End2([结束: 扫描完成])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style End2 fill:#e1f5e1
    style LoadRules fill:#fff3cd
    style SaveReportDB fill:#e3f2fd
    style SaveCacheDB fill:#e3f2fd
